  <item>
    <title>022 |「涂鸦人-GAN」品牌纷纷入局IP，怎么样能算一个好IP？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64bd22b3f5660761cf647b5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64bd22b3f5660761cf647b5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jul 2023 12:18:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>涂鸦人/策展人/潮流厂牌主理人</span></p><p><span>《中国嘻哈颁奖典礼》“最佳涂鸦文化推广人”称号</span></p><p><span>小红薯：GAN GAN GAN</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6a15-audiofreehighqps/0A/37/GMCoOR4Iktw3AAOMtQI8s9JJ.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/326d-audiofreehighqps/AE/7E/GMCoOSYIktxJAAhg8gI8s9we.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/e145-audiofreehighqps/24/A2/GMCoOSUIktxaAAijQgI8s-MF.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4b99-audiofreehighqps/E8/36/GMCoOScIktxlAAVKbgI8s-f3.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6e06-audiofreehighqps/80/DB/GMCoOR8Iktx5AAQVowI8s_GP.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3356-audiofreehighqps/65/92/GKwRIW4IktyPAANV9AI8s_oP.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><span>【本期话题】</span></strong><br></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">00:02:08</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;GAN是谁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">00:05:30</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;从一开始就觉得上班没什么意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">00:14:45</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;慢慢摸索之后传统涂鸦慢慢开始思考如何传播</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">00:15:50</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;隔行如隔山，我祝你成功！切忌不要用“立体”来形容一位涂鸦人的作品！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">00:17:43</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;花了100w邀请了全球优秀的涂鸦艺术家，但这件事情并没有被更多人知道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">00:22:00</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;为武汉发声，做了一个“重返春天”的线上活动，被CGTN报道了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">00:33:10</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;决定不做大型活动，开始做IP</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">00:37:00</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;客户愿意花几百万落地我的idea</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">00:41:00</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;一毛坐列车的故事被网友发现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">00:43:18</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;视觉艺术家JR打开了我的想象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">00:45:50</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;买一些知名的IP的书做研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">00:50:20</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;你在城市涂一毛，城市里会让你这样随便涂鸦吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">00:53:00</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;对于IP的思考</span></p>]]></description>
