  <item>
    <title>021 |「公益音乐人-游翔」谁说做音乐的人只会创作，我们也能保护天空</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64aa960566002527428bbb91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64aa960566002527428bbb91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Jul 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>游翔</span></p><p><span>青年长笛演奏家，音乐制作人，五线谱音乐公益创办人，英国伦敦音乐学院London College of Music长笛表演硕士，英国伦敦Point Blank音乐制作学院电子音乐制作研究生。</span></p><p><span>创作编配《Electronic Sonatine for Flute and Synthesizers》 曾于摩洛哥拉巴特大剧院、新加坡李氏基金会音乐厅、新加坡滨海湾艺术中心表演长笛独奏，参加过荷兰鹿特丹华侨跨年晚会、荷兰格罗宁根学联春节晚会、统战部港澳侨界庆祝香港回归25周年活动演奏，曾获马来西亚国际管乐大赛金奖，意大利马萨城国际青年音乐家大赛室内乐组二等奖。与社会各界公益组织/NGO合作音乐艺术公益项目：例如“暗夜音月会”，“音乐艺术可持续发展课程”，“乡村音乐疗愈项目”，“音乐与科普表演”等系列公益项目。</span></p><p><strong><span>特别鸣谢：绿色浙江环保组织</span></strong></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/650e-audiofreehighqps/93/77/GMCoOSQIgCBPAA6mKQI1m0sf.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><strong><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/923f-audiofreehighqps/6A/12/GKwRIJEIgCBlACPzEAI1m1T1.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></strong></p><p><strong><span>【本期话题】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 学习长笛是个意外，但它带我走到了现在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 如何让一家公益组织长期健康的运转下去</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 公益创业和商业创业的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 我想让做音乐的人不止能做音乐家和音乐教育，还可以让世界更好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 让保护环保的公益不止捡垃圾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 随身带着长笛的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2871">47:51</a> 如何加入音乐公益</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIW4IgCuaAZ-gFAI1n9M-.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=44418844&amp;track_id=647221189&amp;uid=102807386&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/bd7f-audiofreehighqps/E9/A1/GKwRIW4IgCuaAZ-gFAI1n9M-.m4a" length="27238420" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/5fcd99d0dee9c1e16d3e3053/FhvkY4cmi7TVmhCE_q05vY-ML4Jp.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>21</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>020 |「塔罗师-妤幸」小孩子都在意结果，而大人想看清现状</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648f06e9bcfa7ac41b7f82b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648f06e9bcfa7ac41b7f82b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jun 2023 13:05:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>妤幸</span></p><p><span>CTA塔罗协会会员/占星师/REIKI疗愈师</span></p><p><span>塔罗从业7年</span><br></p><p><span>vx：taluo257</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/db0d-audiofreehighqps/95/E1/GKwRIDoIZMBYAALsCAIrgw96.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><strong><span>【本期话题】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a>&nbsp; 塔罗师和心理咨询师之间存在着什么联系吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a>&nbsp; 50岁的阿姨也是要算塔罗的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a>&nbsp; 成年人的爱情要看清现状：一位快60岁的姐姐与30岁小伙子的爱情故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a>&nbsp; 未成年的爱情要的是结果：即便是一场看似就遥不可及的网恋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>&nbsp; 做塔罗师之后对世界的新看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a>&nbsp; 即便在特殊的职业，人类对爱情的追求始终没变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a>&nbsp; 塔罗牌到底能看见什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a>&nbsp; 塔罗师会给自己算吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a>&nbsp; 怎么学习做一个靠谱的塔罗师？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a>&nbsp; 塔罗的应用范围</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a>&nbsp; 直觉是真实存在的吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a>&nbsp; 你是什么样子的就会吸引什么样的人</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIaIIZMLwACAAAAIrhI79.mp3.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=44418844&amp;track_id=642428979&amp;uid=102807386&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/1d78-audiofreehighqps/30/C8/GKwRIaIIZMLwACAAAAIrhI79.mp3" length="72154851" type="audio/mp4"/>
