  <item>
    <title>019 |「游戏摄影师Leafy」从虚拟拍到现实，拍照才是我的最终奥义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647c7f58bb93932e317cdccf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647c7f58bb93932e317cdccf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jun 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>老朋友Leafy</span></p><p><span>位于洛杉矶的摄影师</span></p><p><span>上次Leafy来做客还是2021年，聊了与Adobe合作的艺术项目。</span></p><p><span>时隔两年，她在尝试了一个新的职业【游戏摄影师-Capture Artist】，去了北欧的艺术项目，摄影作品被多个杂志和公司关注发表......</span></p><p><span>今天就来聊聊Leafy再虚拟世界和真实世界拍摄的故事。</span></p><p><span><span>Instagram @leafy.yeh</span></span></p><p><span>【本期话题】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a>&nbsp;游戏摄影师Capture Artist是一个怎样的职业，职场氛围怎么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a>&nbsp;不想再拍“炸眼球”的图之后：如何考虑ins掉粉这件事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a>&nbsp;冰岛艺术项目：结识了怎么样的欧洲艺术家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>&nbsp;工作之外，能带来成就感的摄影创作：摄影作品登上Vogue，出售版权给知名跨企业……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a>&nbsp;打工，但不做社畜：打工还能继续创作，这是自己争取到的自由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2096">34:56</a>&nbsp;我想要我的摄影，更纯粹</span></p><br><p><span>Leafy本人</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c1c1-audiofreehighqps/BB/07/GKwRIasIUvW4AAGw-AIlgMWN.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>部分摄影作品，想看更多可以关注leafy的Ins@leafy.yeh</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/9c38-audiofreehighqps/82/21/GKwRIRwIUvXJAAO4YwIlgMlR.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/687c-audiofreehighqps/96/99/GKwRIW4IUvXhAAJTWQIlgM3z.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/05f4-audiofreehighqps/32/AA/GKwRIJEIUvXxAAMB6QIlgNGJ.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIMAIUeHiACAAAAIlLFZc.mp3.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=44418844&amp;track_id=639211860&amp;uid=102807386&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/54c4-audiofreehighqps/E1/E4/GKwRIMAIUeHiACAAAAIlLFZc.mp3" length="59124469" type="audio/mp4"/>
