    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>�吉星高赵�：风水环境科学及家居整理组合</span><br></p><p><span>@高加硬（小红薯）、赵宝慈（B站）</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c40b-audiofreehighqps/E8/EF/GKwRIaIICKGMAAPD4gIM5vbT.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4d85-audiofreehighqps/11/4B/GMCoOR4ICKGNAAPD4gIM5vcO.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><strong><span>【本期话题】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> &nbsp;赵老师成为风水师的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> &nbsp;星座大师们说2023年是人类社会升维的一年，作为风水师怎么看</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> &nbsp;今日说法之高老师深陷塔罗骗局</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> &nbsp;作为风水师对人类社会的观察</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> &nbsp;租房要注意哪些风水问题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> &nbsp;爆款风水日历是什么？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> &nbsp;风水师也是会看心理医生的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> &nbsp;风水师的家里会怎么布置</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> &nbsp;帮人催财，10天到账1个亿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> &nbsp;拜师讲究一个缘分</span><br></p><br><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong><br></p><p><span>Both Sides Now---Emilia Jones</span><br></p><p><span>《吧拉拉小魔仙星缘奇迹》片头曲</span></p>]]></description>
