  <item>
    <title>009 | 「年终总结」今年糟糕透了，但还有无数个让我们感到美好的瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63aff8b027ab08f53b962578</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63aff8b027ab08f53b962578</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 08:25:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期话题】</span></strong><br><span>跟我们一起复盘你的2022吧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">00:03:59</a> 混乱的2022，我们获得的不止是悲观和沮丧</span></p><p><br><span>环境艰难的时刻，人性之光更加闪亮了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">00:35:05</a> 这样“温柔”的朋友，在今天真难得啊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">00:43:03</a> 波澜四起的一年，这些选择更坚定了（哪些东西始终没变？）</span></p><p><br><span>尝试点新鲜的，有多快乐？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3314">00:55:14</a> 人社交媒体时代：你可以暴露自己，但你永远有留下自己秘密的权利</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">00:58:22</a> &nbsp;“一生要强”的人，总会尝到“能屈能伸”的甜头吧</span></p><p><br><span>放过自己吧！！世界大得很呢！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3957">01:05:57</a> 摸鱼就像一场私奔，让我带你去想去的地方</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4109">01:08:29</a> &nbsp;不就是工作、不就是户口、不就是感情，放过自己吧</span></p><br><p><span>许愿是门学问，跟我们一起祝自己新年快乐吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4846">01:20:46</a> &nbsp;读书吧，敬畏这个世界。新年快乐！</span></p><br><p><span>【Special thanks】</span></p><p><span>To 航哥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">00:19:58</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">00:35:05</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p><br><span>To 朋友们</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">00:24:57</a>&nbsp;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">00:51:48</a></span></p><br><p><span>To克里斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">00:44:06</a></span><br></p><br><p><strong><span>【本期配乐】</span></strong><br></p><p><span>红蜻蜓---小虎队</span></p><p><span>Sugar man---Rodriguez</span></p><p><span>倔强---五月天</span></p><p><span>朋友---周华健</span></p><p><span>自从有了你---平生不晚,渝羡&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>私奔---郑钧</span></p><p><span>三百六十五个祝福---蔡国庆</span></p>]]></description>
